he same images and build pipelines as the remediation, so it is not separately schedulable from this epic.\n54\t- **HLR-2 (P0, partial input)** — produces the data-plane module inventory, build attestations, and test results consumed by the compliance evidence package.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b541f3c1e68683f5","agent_id":"ada89111e39959723","session_id":"c8475876-08d1-4b69-838f-3e562b4843af","uuid":"2bf32ed0-e467-4453-8824-801c5eda458f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:24:17.028Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a7d39ecbd257b56","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
