he same images and build pipelines as the remediation, so it is not separately schedulable from this epic.\n54\t- **HLR-2 (P0, partial input)** — produces the data-plane module inventory, build attestations, and test results consumed by the compliance evidence package.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a33364966471fe34","agent_id":"af492226073e666b9","session_id":"c8475876-08d1-4b69-838f-3e562b4843af","uuid":"4c924272-6523-4201-9e8f-44d4ca876b00","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:28:33.499Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9d1cc73b82378423","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013"}
